 "- **FIX-P11 CHARTERED:** `CHROME.toolbarHeight` (64) is the desktop figure; the phone wizard toolbar is 68 — a phone toolbar-height token in `src/components/theme.js`, FIX-P10's exact pin `[4,4,4,4,0,0]` banking the win.\n"
